      "text": "        FUNTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n        -UploadVidoes\n        -WatchVideos\n        -Pause/Resume Playback\n        -Search Videos\n        -Like,Comment\n        -Subscribe Channels\n        -Home Feed\n        -View Count",
