      "versionNonce": 106681125,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785649140446,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "    Back of the envelop estimations\n    500M DAU\n    5 Videos Watched per day per user =2.5B\nReads/D=29000R/s\n    5M Uploads Per Day \n    Avg Upload Size = 500MB\n    Daily Storage Req = 2.5PB/Day\n    Avg Streamed Bytes per video = 200MB\n    Daily Read Vol = 200 x 2.5 = 500PB/Day ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "jgfxmI4r5ZFxQmbfTfMN5",
      "originalText": "    Back of the envelop estimations\n    500M DAU\n    5 Videos Watched per day per user =2.5B Reads/D=29000R/s\n    5M Uploads Per Day \n    Avg Upload Size = 500MB\n    Daily Storage Req = 2.5PB/Day\n    Avg Streamed Bytes per video = 200MB\n    Daily Read Vol = 200 x 2.5 = 500PB/Day ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
