      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785649158050,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "    CLIENT\n    1. Post /videos\n    \n    UploadManager\n    8. CreateUploadSession\n    9. a. Workers read respective chunk bytes and upload\n        b.Receive etag in response\n    \n    10. Free workers pick next chunk\n    11. Retry with exp backoff on failure\n    12. On complete send all parts and etags to S3\n        Options: Use presigned complete api url OR\n        call Video Service . I choose this one\n                   ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "j7wX_dSvU3O9qpvWaVrtM",
      "originalText": "    CLIENT\n    1. Post /videos\n    \n    UploadManager\n    8. CreateUploadSession\n    9. a. Workers read respective chunk bytes and upload\n        b.Receive etag in response\n    \n    10. Free workers pick next chunk\n    11. Retry with exp backoff on failure\n    12. On complete send all parts and etags to S3\n        Options: Use presigned complete api url OR\n        call Video Service . I choose this one\n                   ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
