      "text": "After Uploading Parts\nUpload Session (uploadId = XYZ)\n\nPart 1  -> bytes + ETag1\nPart 2  -> bytes + ETag2\nPart 3  -> bytes + ETag3\n...\nPart 64 -> bytes + ETag64",
