      "locked": false,
      "text": "7. \nPresigned URL \nhttps://youtube-prod-videos.s3.amazonaws.com/videos/vid_123/original.mp4?\npartNumber=5&\nuploadId=XYZ123&\nX-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&\nX-Amz-Credential=...\nX-Amz-Date=...\nX-Amz-Expires=3600\nX-Amz-Signature=...\n\na. Generate All - TTL 1 Hr - Upto few GB. \nb. Large Upload - Get Batch URLs when few remaining ask for more",
