      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1233354153,
      "version": 569,
      "versionNonce": 588373943,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785860707968,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Client\n0. GET /videos/{videoId}/play\n5. Download the master manifest\n6. Based on current network quality, device\nresolution, user pref, battery mode\n7. Download variant playlist \nGET  480/playlist.m3u8\n8. Determine segment, if start ->first segment\nif resume -> 17:42 -> 4sec segment-> 1062 sec =\n266 segment\n9. Segment contains compressed vid data\n10. Decode for showing on screen",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "G6ljKu9RlLyofEYtW1FPQ",
      "originalText": "Client\n0. GET /videos/{videoId}/play\n5. Download the master manifest\n6. Based on current network quality, device resolution, user pref, battery mode\n7. Download variant playlist \nGET  480/playlist.m3u8\n8. Determine segment, if start ->first segment\nif resume -> 17:42 -> 4sec segment-> 1062 sec = 266 segment\n9. Segment contains compressed vid data\n10. Decode for showing on screen",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
